# API Route Conventions

- Wrap all handler logic in `try/catch`.
- Never expose `OPENAI_API_KEY` or `BEYOND_PRESENCE_API_KEY` to the client; proxy AI calls here only.
- On external API failure, return JSON: `{ "error": "message" }` with an appropriate HTTP status.
- Run Supabase queries in `/api` endpoints, not in frontend components.
